  "description": "Meet the FLUX — Your Everyday Ride, Supercharged.The Pure Cycles FLUX is built to make every ride easier, faster, and more fun. With powerful rear hub motor, responsive pedal assist, and a long-range battery, it’s ready for everything from daily commutes to weekend adventures. Clean lines, comfortable geometry, and a smart onboard display keep you connected and in control, while integrated lights and thoughtful details make it ride-ready right out of the box. Just hop on and go — FLUX does the rest.\nACT Lab tested to UL 2849 & UL 2271 standards\nComfort-focused alloy frame & ergonomic touchpoints: Built for all-day riding comfort, the FLUX features a lightweight yet durable aluminum frame with relaxed geometry for an upright, easygoing ride. Available in both step-over and step-thru designs to suit a wide range of rider heights and preferen\nPowerful 350W Bafang rear hub motor delivers up to 55 N·m of torque for confident acceleration and smooth hill climbing.\nPowered by a 48V / 15Ah lithium-ion battery, the FLUX delivers up to 60 miles of range on a single charge. The battery is sleekly integrated into the frame and can be fully charged either on or off the bike in under 8 hours.\nColorful display with Bluetooth & USB-C accessories charging port keeps you informed with real-time data and charge your devices on the go.\nSelect from a range of power assist levels from Eco to Boost to match your ride. Or simply use the throttle for effortless cruising without pedaling.\nSmart Pedal Assist with Torque & Cadence Sensor naturally adjusts to how fast and how hard you pedal.\nRide safely in low light with built-in front and rear lights controlled from the handlebar display. The rear light features a deceleration sensor which glows brighter when slowing and stopping.\nWhether climbing hills or navigating city streets, the Shimano 7-speed drivetrain with easy-to-use Revo shifter delivers quick, intuitive gear changes with a simple twist, and a wide gearing range for reliable performance on any terrain.\nAdd the available accessory rear rack with MIK compatible mounting to carry your favorite MIK accessories like a Children’s seat, or quickly swap out to your favorite bags to bring home the groceries from the local market run.",
